{"speciesId":318,"names":{"fr":"Carvanha","es":"Carvanha","en":"Carvanha","ja":"キバニア"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"CARVANHA’s strongly developed jaws and its sharply pointed fangs pack the destructive power to rip out boat hulls. Many boats have been attacked and sunk by this POKéMON."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"If anything invades CARVANHA’s territory, it will swarm and tear at the intruder with its pointed fangs. On its own, however, this POKéMON turns suddenly timid."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"CARVANHA attack ships in swarms, making them sink. Although it is said to be a very vicious POKéMON, it timidly flees as soon as it finds itself alone."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It lives in massive rivers that course through jungles. It swarms prey that enter its territory."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It lives in massive rivers that course through jungles. It swarms prey that enter its territory."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"They form packs to attack boats and rip out their hulls to sink them. They live in rivers in the jungle."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"They form packs to attack boats and rip out their hulls to sink them. They live in rivers in the jungle."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il attaque en banc quand on menace son territoire. Ses dents aiguisées peuvent couler un navire."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il attaque en banc quand on menace son territoire. Ses dents aiguisées peuvent couler un navire."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il s’attaque en banc aux bateaux dont il dévore la coque. Les rivières de la jungle forment son habitat."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Atacan en grupo a los barcos y los hunden a base de bocados. Habitan en los ríos de la jungla."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They form packs to attack boats and rip out their hulls to sink them. They live in rivers in the jungle."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"集団で 船に 襲いかかり 船底を 食いちぎり 沈める。 ジャングルの 川に 生息する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ce Pokémon vit dans les fleuves qui traversent les forêts tropicales. Il attaque en groupe ceux qui s’aventurent sur son territoire."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Habita caudalosos ríos que atraviesan las junglas. Si alguien invade su territorio, acude con más de su especie."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It lives in massive rivers that course through jungles. It swarms prey that enter its territory."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ジャングルを 流れる 大河に 生息。 縄張りに 紛れこんだ 獲物を 集団で 襲う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les mâchoires surdéveloppées de Carvanha et ses crocs acérés sont si puissants qu’ils peuvent déchirer la coque des bateaux. De nombreux navires ont été attaqués et coulés par ce Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Carvanha, gracias a las descomunales fauces de afilados colmillos que tiene, es capaz de hacer trizas un barco. Son muchas las naves que han sufrido el ataque de este Pokémon y han acabado naufragando."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Carvanha’s strongly developed jaws and its sharply pointed fangs pack the destructive power to rip out boat hulls. Many boats have been attacked and sunk by this Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"発達した アゴと 鋭く とがった キバは 船底を かみ千切る ほどの 破壊力。 キバニアに 襲われ 沈んだ 船は 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Si un intrus s’aventure sur le territoire des Carvanha, ils se ruent sur lui et le mordent à l’aide de leurs crocs acérés. En revanche, lorsqu’il est seul, ce Pokémon devient tout à coup très timide."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Si algo o alguien invade el territorio de los Carvanha, se acercarán en masa y harán trizas al intruso con los afilados colmillos. Sin embargo, cuando están en solitario, estos Pokémon se vuelven tímidos de repente."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"If anything invades Carvanha’s territory, it will swarm and tear at the intruder with its pointed fangs. On its own, however, this Pokémon turns suddenly timid."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"テリトリーを 荒らす ものには 集団で 襲いかかり とがった キバで 八つ裂きにする。 １匹に なると 途端に 弱腰に なるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il protège son territoire en se déplaçant en banc. Le moindre intrus est raccompagné sans pitié, à grands claquements de mâchoire."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Cada banco de Carvanha tiene su propio territorio. En cuanto detectan a un intruso, sacan los dientes y lo atacan sin miramientos."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Each school has its own territory. Any intruders are mercilessly attacked with fangs bared."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"群れごとに テリトリーを 持っている。 侵入する 者は 容赦なく キバを むきだしにして 襲いかかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"En banc, il guette l’odeur du sang et fond sur sa proie sans aucune pitié. Seul, il se montre plus timoré."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"En cuanto huelen la menor cantidad de sangre, todo el grupo ataca a la presa, pero cuando van en solitario se amilanan fácilmente."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"If they scent the faintest trace of blood, they rush to attack en masse. When alone, they’re rather cowardly."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"わずかな 血の 匂いを 嗅ぎつけ 集団で 獲物を 襲う。 １匹では 結構 おくびょう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"C’est un couard qui ne chasse jamais tout seul. Dès qu’il se retrouve dans un groupe de cinq, par contre, il devient on ne peut plus féroce !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Es algo timorato, por lo que nunca va solo. Pero, en cuanto se reúnen cinco ejemplares, de pronto se convierten en una fuerza de la naturaleza."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"They’re such cowards that they won’t hunt alone. When five or so of them get together, they suddenly turn ferocious!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"臆病で １匹では 狩りも しない。 ５匹 くらい 集まると 急に 凶暴に なるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Grâce à sa mâchoire d’acier et ses dents acérées, il déchiquette sans peine les canots. Bargantua et lui se disputent le menu fretin."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Puede destrozar a bocados fácilmente un barco de madera con sus potentes mandíbulas y colmillos. Compite por presas con los Basculin."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"With its sturdy jaws and fangs, it can easily chomp wooden boats to splinters. It fights with Basculin over food."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"丈夫なアゴと キバは 木造の 船 なら 簡単に 噛み砕く。 エサを巡り バスラオと 争う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il ne s’attaque jamais à une proie tout seul, préférant attendre l’arrivée de ses congénères pour lancer l’assaut."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Nunca aborda a su presa en solitario, sino que espera a que lleguen sus semejantes para atacar en grupo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It won’t attack while it’s alone—not even if it spots prey. Instead, it waits for other Carvanha to join it, and then the Pokémon attack as a group."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"獲物を 見つけても １匹のときは 襲わない。 仲間が 来るのを 待って 集団で 襲いかかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il possède une mâchoire puissante garnie de dents acérées. Les marins ne s’approchent jamais des eaux habitées par les Carvanha."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Los marineros evitan por completo las zonas donde habita este Pokémon de afilados colmillos y fuertes mandíbulas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"These Pokémon have sharp fangs and powerful jaws. Sailors avoid Carvanha dens at all costs."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"鋭い キバと たくましい 顎を もつ。 船乗りたちは キバニアの すみかには けっして 近づかない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":318,"moves":[{"name":"take-down","learns":[[5,"level-up",31],[6,"level-up",31],[7,"level-up",31],[8,"level-up",38],[9,"level-up",38],[10,"level-up",38],[11,"level-up",38],[12,"level-up",31],[13,"level-up",31],[14,"level-up",38],[15,"level-up",38],[16,"level-up",43],[17,"level-up",43],[18,"level-up",43],[20,"level-up",44],[23,"level-up",44]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"egg",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[13,"tutor",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,